ass=\"ip-icon-curtains\"></i>\nעיצוב\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"מוזיקה\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/11-מוזיקה\"><i class=\"ip-icon-music\"></i>\nמוזיקה\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"צילום\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/9-צילום\"><i class=\"ip-icon-camera\"></i>\nצילום\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"שמלות כלה וערב\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/2-שמלות-כלה-וערב\"><i class=\"ip-icon-tailored-dress\"></i>\nשמלות כלה וערב\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"איפור ועיצוב שיער\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/5-איפור-ועיצוב-שיער\"><i class=\"ip-icon-cosmetics\"></i>\nאיפור ועיצוב שיער\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"צילום מגנטים\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/10-צילום-מגנטים\"><i class=\"ip-icon-pictures\"></i>\nצילום מגנטים\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"הזמנות ומיתוג\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/23-הזמנות-ומיתוג-לאירוע\"><i class=\"ip-icon-wedding-invitation\"></i>\nהזמנות ומיתוג\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"הסעות לאורחים\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/19-הסעות-לאורחים\"><i class=\"ip-icon-bus\"></i>\nהסעות לאורחים\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"תכשיטים ואקססוריז\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/32-תכשיטים-ואקססוריז\"><i class=\"ip-icon-wedding-rings\"></i>\nתכשיטים ואקססוריז\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"הפקת אירוע\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/37-הפקת-אירוע\"><i class=\"ip-icon-planner\"></i>\nהפקת אירוע\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"אטרקציות\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/18-אטרקציות\"><i class=\"ip-icon-party\"></i>\nאטרקציות\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"empty\" style=\"visibility: hidden\">\n<a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"ip-icon-table-with-chairs\"></i>\n&nbsp;\n</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"dropdown open\">\n<ul class=\"dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-lg\">\n<li class=\"header text-muted\">We're here for any question</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"/en-US/front/contact\"><i class=\"fas fa-envelope\"></i>\nContact us\n</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<main role=\"main\">\n<section class=\"section section-lg section-hero text-center\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<h1>Want to join us?</h1>\n<h2 class=\"section-hero-subtitle\">College graduates looking for a nurturing environment to grow in, students looking for a job with flexible hours? We want you!  </h2>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section section-lg work\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-24 text-center\">\n<h2 class=\"space-b-xs-6 space-b-sm-12\">Expanding the family</h2>\n<p>Come and take part in the project that changed the event field in Israel!\n<br>We believe the most important part of a company are the people it's made of, and so, we always look for people who want to make a difference. We consider every employee as part of a very unified family, try us and see for yourselves.  </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section section-lg office\">\n<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-12 text-center\">\n<div class=\"width-wrapper\">\n<h2 class=\"space-b-xs-6 space-b-sm-12\">At iPlan you come to work with a smile :)</h2>\n<div class=\"space-b-xs-25 space-b-sm-0\"><p>We work in a field that's all about happiness, our team connects with clients that are in the most exciting time of their lives. In order to be a part of this unique team you need to eat, drink and breath service orientation, courtesy, kindness and professionalism. And you can't get any of those without the kind of work environment that makes you smile everyday. </p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-12 text-center\">\n<div class=\"wrapper\"><img class=\"desaturate\" alt=\"מסדרון במשרד\" src=\"/assets/front_jobs__office.jpg\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section section-lg meeting\">\n<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-12 text-center col-sm-push-12\">\n<div class=\"width-wrapper\">\n<h2 class=\"space-b-xs-6 space-b-sm-12\">Only the best, no compromises!&nbsp;</h2>\n<div class=\"space-b-xs-25 space-b-sm-0\"><p>In order to be able to give our clients service in the high standards their expecting (and so are we), we only hire true professionals that posses work ethics and service orientation as built in qualities. As a growing company there is always something new happening, something new to learn so you can really fulfill your maximum potential.    </p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-12 text-center col-sm-pull-12\">\n<div class=\"wrapper\"><img class=\"\" alt=\"חדר ישיבות\" src=\"/assets/front_jobs__meeting.jpg\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section section-lg job_openings\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"slide-panel fixed-top\" style=\"top: 1382.72px; position: absolute;\">\n<h2 class=\"space-b-xs-6 space-b-sm-12\">We want people who are game changers!</h2>\nIf you want to be a part of a the leading company in it's field of business, if your'e the kind of people who don't give themselves any slack and always aim to excel in anything you do, if your'e looking for a steady career or a part time job as a student, you'll fit right in! Check out the positions available right now!\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-24 col-md-12 col-md-offset-12 col-lg-12 col-lg-offset-12\">\n<div class=\"openings\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"text-center\">\n<div class=\"container space-xs-12 space-sm-21\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-xs-24 col-sm-6 space-b-xs-5\">\n<h2 class=\"footer-column-title\">iPlan</h2>\n<div class=\"space-t-xs-1\"><a href=\"/en-US/front/contact\">Contact us</a></div>\n<div class=\"space-t-xs-1\"><a href=\"/en-US/front/about\">About</a></div>\n<div class=\"space-t-xs-1\"><a href=\"/en-US/fron